# The cloud workers need cloud/ and nothing else. Without this the build context is
# the whole monorepo — hundreds of MB of NFL play-by-play parquet, the RacingEngine
# seed and the Next.js site — none of which any worker uses.
#
# Keep ALL of cloud/: the odds collector and the race-day tempo worker both build
# from this directory (cloud/Dockerfile and cloud/Dockerfile.tempo).
*
!cloud/
